Interpretation:
  F=ma  succeeds → PySR-GB works for single-valued explicit relations.
  Circle fails   → PySR-GB cannot handle multi-valued implicit varieties.
  SR-GB handles both by working directly in the polynomial nullspace,
  treating all variables symmetrically without designating a target.

